  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Load Testing resources can now be moved across resource groups or across subscriptions in the same tenant,&nbsp;without losing any tests and test runs.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/azure/load-testing/how-to-move-between-resource-groups-subscriptions?wt.mc_id=azloadtesting_azupdates202308_webpage_cnl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more about moving resources.</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Load Testing resources can now be moved across resource groups or across subscriptions in the same tenant, without losing any tests and test runs.\n\nLearn more about moving resources."
  },
